Z||000003||Gold-86SE||05-23-2000||03:48 PM||||<BR>Conversations with one's self, now that is scary. That's way scarier that any flame thrown at anyone.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>BTW, Good Kill.<P>All this talk about kills, reminded of a situation I had a lunch.<P>Two girls, one in a mitsu eclipse, the other an acura. You know the type, blonde, windows down, sunroof up, hair flying in the wind, oversize wheels, thinking they are all that.<P>Well I see them coming up behind me (not yet knowing the gender of the drivers) then they pass me and i glance over to see who owns/drives these ricers.<P>I was already doing 10 over the posted speed limit when they passed, but having seen the drivers I just could not pass up the opportunity to work on these ricers.<P>Dropped it to 3rd, so I could get that extra punch and growl caught up to them at the light and we waited for the green.<P>Now, we were behind people so we could not race, but they started shifting gears and squirrling around the traffic like they were queens.<P>These girls, were in 4th gear before I left 2nd, got around one of them and backed off the throttle just enough to let it rattle in her window.  Passed her, then caught up the the lead girl, but had to fall in behind due to traffic in the right lane.<P>I was expecting her to romp on it, but she signaled left, went to the idiot lane and drove there a few hundred feet allowing me to pass her.<P>This was all done in less than a mile, so not a true kill, but still had fun.  BTW, to my wife, whom i know reads the forum - I was not flerting.<P>Ricers dream on.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Gold-86SE (edited 05-23-2000).]||||reg||10
Z||000004||lennyb4||05-23-2000||03:55 PM||||Hehehehehe...You guys should have seen it.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Coming back from lunch today. 1995 Accord, flame red, whale fin, dual fart cans, stickers + stickers + stickers, wheels sticking out 4" per side, and every other ricer mod you could think of. I couldnt help but look at the guy and laugh my a** off. Then he floored it ..vvrrrrooooommmmm..<BR>sounded like my lawnmower on steriods.||||reg||1
