Z||000008||87PegasusGT||05-24-2000||03:48 PM||||Sorry . No offense to anyone. It was meant in reference to the MR2 pattern as opposed to any race. I am not biased in any way.<BR>I love my 3.4 but I will like it more with a turbo   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> All said and done, it cost me  $2600 to have a shop do it and this included new tranny mounts and stuff like that. With baffle removed, chip, low temp thermo & fan, high output muffler & cat, I am guestimating around 200hp. I did take it up to 80 in 3rd and it will do 150mph. It is not near fast enough for me because I am just a hair slower than an LS1 TransAM but that will all change  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> he he he ||||reg||1
